    <description>Semantically matches a transitioning veteran to the single best active mentor by civilian role and bio content across the FULL active roster. Queries all Active NM_Mentor__c, builds a corpus, calls NM_Find_Mentor_Template (cluster key is a tie-breaker only — cross-cluster matches allowed), then validates the returned Id against a live query before returning verbatim record fields. Contact_Email__c is never queried or surfaced. Returns found=true + mentor fields on match; found=false + message otherwise. NMDH-24.</description>
